  "body": "https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-fetch 3.3.1 \"Transmit body for request\".\r\n\r\nIf the service worker has provided a response, it should have transmitted the body itself in a separate call to fetch, or transmitting is unnecessary since the SW provided a response from the cache API or similar.",
